      "writtenOn": "2023-07-26T04:17:13Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "As you can see, ttm_tt_populate() was just exported 3 years ago as its maintainer refactored TTM. ttm_tt_unpopulte() has not been exported yet just there is no user in the upstream kernel and no mobile GPU is using TTM.\nI know ack team recommends upstreaming and I agree. However, as you know we can\u0027t upstream just our GPU driver without a platform that runs the GPU in the upstream kernel. Exynos2200 is not upstreamed yet and it is the first SOC with Xclipse GPU.",
      "parentUuid": "d56637b5_8eeea811",
      "revId": "ad78fb1f9ae2bcc7ca1d8cdd3b05ab3c46aa5b68",
